abstract: >-
  The Enterprise Concept Framework (ECF) is a descriptive instrument:
  every enterprise can be completely described as the product of two
  partitions — the kind of work it does (7 domains) and the phases
  that work passes through (7 stages). The framework is axiom-derived
  from a single grounding axiom, lifecycle-aware (every object passes
  through every stage), and industry-agnostic. ECF is the conceptual
  skeleton of the TechNeHub Labs DEA ecosystem.